{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32202","headline":"西陵道士茶歌 · 温庭筠","name":"西陵道士茶歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乳窦溅溅通石脉，绿尘愁草春江色。\n涧花入井水味香，山月当人松影直。\n仙翁白扇霜鸟翎，拂坛夜读黄庭经。\n疎香皓齿有余味，更觉鹤心通杳冥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}